                                                                                "summary":  "Brown profiles Ron Baron\u0027s track record at Baron Capital, whose funds have outperformed the market for decades by taking concentrated, long-term positions in transformative companiesÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Âmost famously Tesla and SpaceX. The Baron Partners Fund has beaten all major indices and peer funds since 2003 by holding exceptional businesses through extreme volatility and widespread investor skepticism. Baron\u0027s edge is not a formula but a disposition: deep conviction in visionary founders and the psychological discipline to not sell during drawdowns.",
